{"4525600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outpost Liberation", "steam_appid": 4525600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outpost Liberation</strong> is a tactical outpost-clearing shooter focused on <strong>speed, precision, and strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone field agent sent deep behind enemy lines to dismantle a network of hostile bases. Each mission is a compact sandbox where every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the area with binoculars, mark enemy positions, and plan the perfect infiltration route. Move silently, eliminate guards, sabotage key targets, and escape before the alarm spreads across the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission rewards <strong>efficient execution</strong>. The faster and cleaner you complete the objective, the higher your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different approaches — stealth infiltration, long-range sniping, or aggressive assault — and compete for the best clear times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525600/extras/92199f91b3a64e75e59ba7e3312e5693.poster.avif?t=1778823992\" width=900 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525600/extras/92199f91b3a64e75e59ba7e3312e5693.webm?t=1778823992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525600/extras/92199f91b3a64e75e59ba7e3312e5693.mp4?t=1778823992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outpost</strong> – full reconnaissance infiltration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste